Cell["Papers", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.963642439418721*^9, 3.963642442534361*^9}, {
   3.9636424915182242`*^9, 3.963642541099963*^9}, 
   3.965020653051426*^9},ExpressionUUID->"c6e18d3e-061b-458e-8ceb-\
ac854092ee06"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Advancing mathematics by guiding human intuition with AI", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.96286020639534*^9, 
  3.962860222181673*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"306a4f14-64b8-487f-ab6e-\
fb609f6b09a7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Article", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9628731054638233`*^9, 
  3.9628731074597883`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6ae30d8d-0a70-4366-949c-\
f3b596651858"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Machine learning is used here to discover potential patterns and ",
 StyleBox["relations ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "between mathematical objects. We can use ",
 StyleBox["attribution ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "techniques. So this is typical association type thing. Presents a machine",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "17520503-9a04-4341-b527-d82ec30b8611"],
 "learning",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fb776f0-9494-4f5a-ba98-a48f627662f4"],
 "guided framework and demonstrate its application to some problems. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962861026818104*^9, 3.962861155893798*^9}, {
  3.962862146143656*^9, 
  3.962862149539942*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ce83d4b1-3a43-4f5e-88cf-\
30f7bcbade95"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Prior (non",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "aa77b12c-b501-4b86-a502-7bc8da405be1"],
 "AI) systems for generating conjectures have either been useful in very \
specific fields or are pretty general but don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t generate \
very interesting conjectures. So there\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a tradeoff. ",
 StyleBox["But this paper itself worked in a specific problem. ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9628613244985027`*^9, 3.962861403540357*^9}, {
  3.962861583615403*^9, 3.962861583770743*^9}, {3.962861639265354*^9, 
  3.962861651399694*^9}, {3.962861728895084*^9, 3.962861800417948*^9}, {
  3.962862009610215*^9, 3.962862058317791*^9}, {3.962862138922598*^9, 
  3.962862153272275*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8bded0b9-cab3-4c27-b114-\
3f309fa183bb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "So we can discover some conjectures using these Machine learning \
techniques. The idea is that human intuition is guided by this. So maybe the \
machine learning algorithm helps humans to discover by pointing out that this \
may be related to this. Or can it even think on its own and do the steps of \
the proof. Now, common association frequencies can be tracked and can be seen \
what it is related to. So the AI we create must be used in a creative way to \
help. How exactly does that work? Maybe it can see relationships that humans \
cannot, which can be the case in high",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9d572757-13eb-45b2-accd-2cff9bbfdaee"],
 "dimensions. Here, regression and those things might be useful. However, in \
mathematics, we often deal with exact relationships."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962862200609851*^9, 
  3.9628624021360693`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3db12bd1-77a4-4660-9e72-\
f1f0f294773e"],

Cell["This is the broad structure of the framework", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.962862132455904*^9, 
  3.962862161825136*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1f76fa94-cfc7-4f2a-abe1-\
4c89ce409f50"],

